#. Tag: title
#: man-apper.1.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "Description"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:61
#, no-c-format
msgid "Apper is the &kde; interface for PackageKit"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Apper is able to manage packages, applications and updates in a cross-"
"distribution way thanks to the PackageKit project."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: man-apper.1.docbook:63
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It is providing Linux users a single application that they can learn and use "
"in whatever distribution they are."
msgstr ""

